Who wants to play with me?
Who wants to play with me,
Strike a fire steel.
Fire steel sparks, sell sweet melon;
Sweet melon is bitter, sell tofu;
Tofu is rotten, sell eggs;
Eggs are fragrant, sell ginger;
Ginger is spicy, build a pagoda;
Pagoda is tall, chop three times;
Three chops are fast, cut green vegetables;
Green vegetables are green, go to Beijing.
Go to Beijing, what for?
Visit the Forbidden City, climb Jingshan Hill,
Then go and visit the Summer Palace.
